    "long_instructions": "##AI in My Community: Helpful or Harmful?\r\n###AI in Medicine\r\nClick **Add** > **From Library**. Select and attach the article(s) that you wish the chatbot to engage with.\r\n\r\n###Instructions\r\nConsider using the AI Chat to do one or more of the following:\r\n* Get details from the articles. _Who does this AI help? Who does it hurt?_\r\n* Fact-Check the articles. _What is real and what is exaggerated?_\r\n* Summarize from the viewpoint of a specific community member.\r\n* Ask whose perspective is missing.\r\n",
